{"type":"message","id":"473c7d95","parentId":"08c821f0","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:02:56.051Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning a 500 Internal Server Error and the error code 1101. This might be because the `send` endpoint is expecting a specific format, or the worker itself is throwing an error. Let me check if there's another endpoint available, or maybe I should try different approaches.Let me try:\n1. Maybe the message is too long\n2. Maybe the endpoint requires different fields\n\nLet me also try without threadId in the body but as a query parameter, or vice versa.\n\nActually wait - the initial authentication succeeded with `X-API-KEY` header (I got the history), but the POST /send might need different handling. Or maybe the worker is crashing because of the message content format.\n\n\nLet me test with a minimal payload to isolate whether the issue is with the request structure or the message content itself.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-b0187ca3-0e56-47de-b13d-7f445fedc3ab","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat test\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":387,"output":261,"cacheRead":20368,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21016,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779285758821,"responseId":"chatcmpl-841b6b25-7903-4b14-90f6-b93527bdd8f0"}}
