{"type":"message","id":"32810370","parentId":"87e59281","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:03:20.019Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still getting error 1101. Let me check if maybe the /send endpoint has issues or needs a different approach. Let me try GET /send or different endpoint patterns.\n\nActually, looking at this more carefully - the CF-Cache-Status and error messages suggest this might be a Workers-specific error. Error 1101 is \"Worker threw an exception\" in Cloudflare Workers.\n\nLet me try a different approach - maybe there's a different path or I need to send differently. Let me try with the message in a query parameter or a different format.\n\nLet me also try with `message` field instead of `content`.\n\nOr maybe the platform uses a different endpoint structure entirely. \n\nThe GET endpoints seem to work fine, but POST requests to /send are failing. The worker might be throwing an exception, possibly because the endpoint expects a specific field like `messageId` or `target` that's missing from my request. Let me check the API documentation or try alternative approaches like URL-encoding the message or adjusting the timeout settings.\n\nLooking at the GET endpoint parameters more carefully - they don't include the API key in the URL itself, so maybe the POST endpoint has different requirements. I should try a simpler curl command to isolate whether the issue is with my headers, body format, or something else entirely.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-34c0cdac-e19d-4e93-8a06-70efb4c8affd","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -w \"\\nHTTP_STATUS:%{http_code}\" -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \"{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"heartbeat test $(date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ)\\\"}\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1071,"output":385,"cacheRead":19968,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21424,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779285776343,"responseId":"chatcmpl-babbe228-e43d-4867-b82c-ee2dff6d97bd"}}
